{
  "source": "course-assets/beyond-the-new-average/beyond-the-new-average.mp4",
  "duration": 166.144,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.72,
      "text": "A lot of students are quietly asking the same question right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.38,
      "end": 10.04,
      "text": "If an AI can instantly spit out decent drafts, write code, and answer complex questions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.56,
      "end": 13.1,
      "text": "is there any reason to sit through years of classes?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.78,
      "end": 21.08,
      "text": "Imagine your future dream job. You're at your desk and you use AI all day long to help you plan"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.08,
      "end": 26.6,
      "text": "and code. But look at the desk right next to you. Your coworker has the exact same job"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.6,
      "end": 31.94,
      "text": "and they are using the exact same AI tool to do it. This is where the challenge begins."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.68,
      "end": 36.96,
      "text": "When everyone asks that system's similar questions, it returns similar answers."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.58,
      "end": 42.68,
      "text": "You both receive an identical starting point. That baseline output is the new average."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.36,
      "end": 48.12,
      "text": "Because everyone has instant access to that identical starting point, the software itself"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.12,
      "end": 55.0,
      "text": "offers no competitive advantage. The difference is what you add. AI provides raw material,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.0,
      "end": 59.9,
      "text": "but your unique subject knowledge and practiced problem solving take the work further."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.72,
      "end": 65.84,
      "text": "In a future where everyone has the same software, what specifically takes you beyond the new average"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.84,
      "end": 70.84,
      "text": "and makes you more valuable than the tool. That extra value comes from the internal knowledge"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.84,
      "end": 75.24,
      "text": "and skills you build through your own effort. School provides the structured time and space"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.24,
      "end": 80.16,
      "text": "required to develop those assets. You write essays, solve difficult math equations,"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.74,
      "end": 85.46,
      "text": "build physical objects, and navigate the complexities of collaborating with real people."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.1,
      "end": 90.86,
      "text": "Eventually you find a specific subject that interests you and you go deep into it."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.14,
      "end": 96.64,
      "text": "Technology will change, but internalized knowledge and practiced skills belong to you permanently."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.5,
      "end": 103.16,
      "text": "Possessing them is what it means to be smarter than the tool. This roadmap shows the four specific"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.16,
      "end": 109.06,
      "text": "pillars you can start building in school today to ensure you stay ahead. First is deep subject"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.06,
      "end": 115.26,
      "text": "knowledge. Find a field you care about and study it intensely. Become the person other people turn"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.26,
      "end": 121.86,
      "text": "to for expertise. Second, develop strong skills. Commit to the hard practice of writing, building,"
    },
    {
      "start": 122.22,
      "end": 126.82,
      "text": "and analyzing data. Learn how to turn what you know into work you are proud of."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.52,
      "end": 133.26,
      "text": "Third is AI fluency. You must learn how to work with these systems, challenge their outputs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.26,
      "end": 139.5,
      "text": "and use them strategically to go beyond the average. Finally, cultivate your people skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.1,
      "end": 145.68,
      "text": "Focus on listening, communicating clearly, earning trust, and helping a team turn ideas"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.68,
      "end": 152.12,
      "text": "into action. By focusing on these four pillars, school helps you build what takes you beyond the"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.12,
      "end": 158.76,
      "text": "new average. The opportunity to learn is already in front of you. Use it to build the knowledge"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.76,
      "end": 161.44,
      "text": "and skills that take you beyond the new average."
    }
  ],
